    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42f65fd2be82b223a8428fd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "选拔赛开始的瞬间，我感受到的正是这样的预感。\n事实上，比赛早已进入白热化，观众席的气氛也热得反常――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d154e1f0dd39f1808aad958cfb1d1e2fecbd931e5cf005b404d99fd4b26f4689",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
