    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9ca89015cce1915ea7f78bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "金青色的疾风猛然炸开，战局骤变。\n一名赛马娘劈开马群，转眼就追到了莱茵力量身旁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28bcc2583462735e598c2279316adc4dc9afcc3eb118323a85ffe03aceddebcc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0d6844dde9697f1c5b8099e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "资深训练员A",
      "source_fingerprint": "c562a69cc80221d7226c73b0d8845c937fe686b8cb2fc46366892017d0bd14c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99873adef61c00b25666162d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是，西沙里奥？在最终弯道应该还很靠后的。\n竟然能追到这种程度……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d8b2ef9aca5ee0bbd95376e3062b71ea428729b7afeb4d042472b6c158389e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4097f4d72c27c9245fdfb563",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d779fe587f3958ed5306c18c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔…………还没完呢！！\n哈啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5acb09bb96b9da1dbcbaeb684984cec1c33a263cb8f9d30bbf1e9474ad131285",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cec205c11ff4354abf46361",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是精彩的比赛……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9759fb3fb60f6116c92653439938b1c134191a94965431fe08c296a34693c35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4f66e4f405a4047223e649f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "震耳的心跳声响个不停。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b5ae905e28dedcb87fbdef73fa49bf574966ee2068e723114248ba4069f545",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78ec2fe6679f4ea0e995b0dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "汹涌的思绪如猎犬般扑来，几乎要把这颗心撕碎。\n――脑海里忽然闪过一句神话题材恋爱喜剧里的台词。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c941a7ab1cb19a5a94a0c936cbeb42c2b176aec2825bcfb903fca5004e81018a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e08bb6c16dd9a886d265ab02",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是剧中公爵倾诉爱上伯爵家千金时心情的台词，\n而此刻的冲击正是如此。那记末脚深深烙在脑海中挥之不去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbdc1c38015232f4681c8e3ceb69d2b5407bb2b0305356c615a6a83355f25646",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef7e2b321e56632b41a20c5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥――多么美丽而高贵的名字。仿佛天生就带着女王般的气度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "818b9c917c594c94f4cdb02c3bd044cdadda37cca1ab7cf5e645979efa07987d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c0ca0258f1c528870af1be0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还沉浸在余韵里，观众却已经围到了选手身边。\n我完全慢了半拍。连忙朝人群赶去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4c4f3c1f3cf1c167cfebe1bb94f5b5b133db93e556e206c6e25aa485cdf3045",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9ac1bece56e8971a9af2380",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8f93591be239147283fda28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。『赢下』、『樱花赏』、『橡树大赛』――秋华赏，\n达成三后冠是我的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f532bf61d114495e2a11df0694e3c2c379647332e803064e1524a8d639b35285",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6faa459f3b8eeaf3b1fdb007",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "资深训练员A",
      "source_fingerprint": "c562a69cc80221d7226c73b0d8845c937fe686b8cb2fc46366892017d0bd14c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b2962f79f81ebadba0799a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后冠路线吗……！啊啊，务必一起争取吧！\n你一定能达成的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89f7e566c6c418b247669fe4b93bfb27b519631689714504b849418f6bfe395e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15616657c551d839bd339751",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "资深训练员A",
      "source_fingerprint": "c562a69cc80221d7226c73b0d8845c937fe686b8cb2fc46366892017d0bd14c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
