    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59c36a904f9e3865dbbdcb28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想先通过交谈……加深彼此的了解。\n踏上闪耀系列赛之后，我们就要并肩前行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf4bf1ec36f8462e21d2eaeabae31b4656c9c408475c54c594110adfe02f31d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
