      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就是，成为未来赛马娘的基石――\n因此我必须，为证明自己的器量，赢下比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7abbe923553f2fafce5ff77823c26ce198c6b1695dcb80d757f66b1856c8d5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
