    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51753eea48f723787e4813f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尤其是『橡树大赛』的胜利不容错过。\n橡树女王的荣冠，必须亲手摘取……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5627a31d4808a7192a52ee77499937d1bf13c5ac0be6a54a39f9b7ac65b1c5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
