    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3236edec02726ce9c30692ac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所谓基石，所谓证明器量究竟是怎么回事？\n――即使到了用餐时间，我仍满脑子都是她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0d66ee3ee3d1190df61e16f6494ad9251799b4b5fc9fedd785dc242d50a35f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
