      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那边就拜托你了。……您的衣摆也沾上了呢。\n我马上替您去除污渍。上衣，可以借给我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f227d2732ad9250b1d822cdef2be1ebb576e714e8d0eb45e3e5ef527056a2fe2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
