    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99a1c30a2e762a49ab11d341",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "依言脱下外套递过去后，她在弄脏的布料下\n垫上手帕，用湿毛巾轻轻拍打起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "180e4921cf48604bae0b10126dae7dff19fbca78271638dcf346443b724fb2ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
