    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45d0d3dd50f5ddae24a328a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个，杯子已经空了，需要添水吗？\n常温水，还是温开水更好呢？我，这就去拿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ac020b39e311424d0af2e5a5882c9723a122d9537bc815f047406c990b99c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
