    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8091d337cb53982551aefc0d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正如赛前评价所说，参赛的尽是才华横溢的赛马娘。\n重赏赛般的紧张感，让我不自觉地攥紧了拳头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3feab4a4b1329bcb320ca801dfa5fb7a464ea92acbdfb90cb7f1ace737e7063",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
