    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f1c68d591d0c7975b19bc0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "眼前毫无疑问就是选拔赛时见过的西沙里奥。\n可是，她那骑士般凛然的神情却无处可寻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15b63a84a9a221e45989f2a14d5266818f3e06900266d0db78680f8530e80ce0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110001.json",
      "json_path": [
