      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，偶尔也会有人问我『哪个才是真正的西沙里奥？』，\n其实都是我。区别只在于有没有绷紧神经，仅此而已……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "231516648eacea5da8482cd1af702e57ca53155ff27be5e315cf6cd7d0d291bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
