      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便听她这么解释，仍觉得判若两人。\n想必她平时对自己要求极为严格吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adb5ee5e299d0c444fb2d2cfad16141f6eb5908256b2f01f42f0fc93b5a59717",
